272
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,840
T'adonaré que has de provar-les.

273
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:53,840
D'acord, recomanem-me un menjar.

274
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:57,840
Lohori, pa i nan.

275
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:59,840
Pa, pa i nan.

276
