305
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,840
Ostres! Espera, espera.

306
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:01,840
Vol sortir el vídeo?

307
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:03,840
I sí, sí, sí, ja ho veieu.

308
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:05,840
Repte aconseguit.

309
